{"info": {"address1": "Mahindra Towers", "address2": "Dr. G. M. Bhosale Marg Worli", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400018", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 2490 1441", "fax": "91 22 2490 0833", "website": "https://www.mahindra.com", "industry": "Auto Manufacturers", "industryKey": "auto-manufacturers", "industryDisp": "Auto Manufacturers", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Mahindra & Mahindra Limited provides mobility products and farm solutions in India and internationally. It operates through five segments: Automotive; Farm Equipment; Auto Investments; Farm Investments; and Investments in Industrial Businesses and Consumer Services. The company offers commercial vehicles, trucks, buses, vans, passenger cars, utility vehicles, and electric vehicles (EV), as well as motorcycles; aero and defense products; offers construction equipment, such as rotaries, tillers, loaders, and backhoes under the Mahindra EarthMaster brand; and road construction equipment comprising motor graders under the Mahindra RoadMaster brand. It is also involved in the provision of farm equipment, including tractors under the Mahindra, Swaraj, and Trakstar brands, as well as farm mechanization solutions, such as rotavators, cultivators, harvesters, rice transplanters, balers, sprayers, and implements and attachments; and renewable energy business comprising installation of EV chargers and provision of Li-ion batteries. In addition, the company offers financial services, such as fixed deposits, retail and other loans, leasing, SME finance, housing finance, mutual funds, and life and non-life insurance broking services, as well as vehicle and equipment financing; provides logistics services; power backup solutions, including diesel and gas generators; and technology services comprising business process, integrated engineering, infrastructure and cloud, network, application development and maintenance, supply chain digital transformation, and design services. Further, it engages in the sale of timeshare and vacation ownership through its resorts; develops and sells residential properties, and engages in the development, management, and operation of commercial complexes; and processing and trading of steel for automotive, non-automotive, and power industries. The company has a strategic partnership with Embraer S.A. for the development of C-390 Millennium multi-mission military transport aircraft in India. The company was incorporated in 1945 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anand Gopal Mahindra", "age": 70, "title": "Non-Executive Chairman & Member of Group Executive Board", "yearBorn": 1955, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 28740000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Anish Dilip Shah Ph.D.", "age": 56, "title": "MD, Group CEO, Member of the Group Executive Board & Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 473319000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amarjyoti  Barua", "age": 47, "title": "President & Group Chief Financial Officer & Member of Executive Board", "yearBorn": 1978, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajesh Ganesh Jejurikar", "age": 61, "title": "Executive Director & CEO of Automotive and Farm Sectors & Member of Group Exe Board", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 382747000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manoj  Bhat", "age": 52, "title": "Member of Group Executive Board", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hemant  Sikka", "age": 56, "title": "MD & CEO of Mahindra Logistics and Member of Group Exe Board", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Veejay Ram Nak